From ae19229975aed46cb94ce98eca81ee47b34cc55e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:28:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(xtask): Gate maps name the crate that owns the module;
 quick maps legacy app::<module>

Rewrite 96 suite headers from app::<moved module> to the owner crate, give heidenhain_cycles a
map, teach quick to read app's re-exports and also match the legacy spelling, pin it with unit
tests (post, sim, motion module changes) and a real-tree check. Bumps PROCESS_VERSION to 17.

Fixes #922

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
